  ⚠ scriptc(no-computed-dynamic-import): computed `import()` specifiers stay fenced in scriptc
   ╭─[no_computed_dynamic_import.tsx:1:32]
 1 │ const name = './worker'; await import(name);
   ·                                ────────────
   ╰────
  help: Literal `import()` of compiled ESM/TypeScript modules and supported Node builtins compiles without the dynamic engine; a computed specifier requires `--dynamic` (or lands on an explicit fence).

